{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fe26b95eaa5cc3848a6d8db09c55e9416f72059f4d8d97271f709df3326ebb45","ja":"お花見公演セカンドステージ！","zh":"赏花公演第二舞台！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"869c28ce2c9b2c748260c963ef71a3abcccb65fbe5a87e6d46b5d16b46c3e8e6","ja":"みんな、聞いた！？　次のイベントライブ、\n屋外ステージでやるんだってね♪","zh":"大家，听说了吗！？听说下次的活动演出，\n要在室外舞台举办呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bec79a1bb9745a3c89a033f7b5382ebbfa17a66d237d26cfd3a4bee7095d81b2","ja":"はい！　セットリストも今日で決まるそうですし、\n後は本番までレッスン頑張りましょう！","zh":"好的！听说歌单今天也能定下来了，\n接下来就努力练习，直到正式演出吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0ac1c1ce1760420491ec018a92974f917c92ea77e7c1c42ea96b2e5844339b97","ja":"せっかく外でやるんだから、オレたちの\nパフォーマンスでめっちゃ盛り上がってほしいよな！","zh":"难得在室外办一场，真希望大家能因我们的\n表演彻底嗨起来啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e14ac16e94ffe6487ea34de4219565cb469c306cea1751edbf1d561c1254f8e2","ja":"この間のお花見公演みたいにね！\nファンの子からの評判もよかったみたいだし。","zh":"就像上次的赏花公演一样！\n粉丝们的反响似乎也很不错呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"5c2bdd63d4ea4dd5796b0906244e2e9758ad09fae348cb106f74264486cac8a2","ja":"うん。でも、「一緒にお花見できなくて残念」\nっていう感想もあったよね……。","zh":"嗯。不过，也有感想说\n“没能一起赏花真遗憾”呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"e1b831720aed032996a1cfcd50f239634837debce36299ae919c2225231634f0","ja":"特殊な公演でしたからね。\nチケットの倍率も、かなり高かったとか。","zh":"毕竟是一场特殊的演出呢。\n听说门票的抽选竞争率也相当高。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"c57c9b09e35fe6d21b79b02419c45f828f33f90415f7577aa7349ecd50188b00","ja":"そっか……\n落選した人、次のライブには来れるといいよね。","zh":"这样啊……\n没抽中的人，要是下次演出能来就好了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"db127dcf449c24d86b9ee77f3db89abad627c8eff25918b7089304fac8169dc6","ja":"はい。それで、今度のステージも、\nみんなでお花見ができたらいいなって……。","zh":"是的。所以，要是下次的舞台\n也能和大家一起赏花就好了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"c87ee00d8c2b14cbac780e126434d16a95ae2880cf82219fc178a05963ea754f","ja":"次もみんなで……！","zh":"下次也要和大家一起……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1170.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d3863a9f8f1f93140a67bdbf104738bfaef5a33b2e4513b7dabeabd23a141927","ja":"うん、いいと思うよ！　みんなで考えてみようよ！\nお花見公演……セカンドステージ！！","zh":"嗯，我觉得挺好的！大家一起来想想看吧！\n赏花公演……第二阶段！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
